@startuml
title Pipeline of a pull request: every gate must pass before a merge
start
:Pull request opened or updated;
:Secrets scan;
if (a secret found?) then (yes)
  :Blocked: the secret is rotated;
  stop
else (no)
endif
fork
  :Title of the request\nConventional Commits form;
fork again
  :Contracts\nstyle and compatibility;
fork again
  :Services\nformat, compile, unit tests,\narchitecture rules,\ndomain coverage and mutation;
fork again
  :Storefront\nlint, unit tests, build;
fork again
  :Infrastructure and charts\nvalidation, security scan,\nplan posted on the request;
end fork
:Component tests\nwith containers;
:Static analysis\nof the new code;
:Dependencies\ninventory and vulnerabilities;
if (all gates passed?) then (yes)
  :Review by a person;
  :Merge to the main branch;
  stop
else (no)
  :Blocked: the author fixes;
  stop
endif
@enduml
